# Vendored capture binary + object files built on each node by
# `setup.py build_ext` / the capture Makefile. These are per-host build
# artifacts (not source); leaving them untracked made `git status
# --porcelain` non-empty, which tripped the dsa_monitor update_dsart
# dirty-worktree gate on all fleet nodes (2026-05-28). Ignore them so
# fleet updates stay clean without needing force=true.
src/dsart/capture/dsart_capture_manythread
src/dsart/capture/*.o

# Fringe-stopping table master copies. Built on h23 via the
# Control-tab "Build for this DEC" button (tools/build_fstable_cache.py
# in the casa38 env). The dashboard rsyncs them out to
# /home/ubuntu/data/fstables/ on every corr node; the repo tree is
# never the source of truth at runtime, so don't track them. See
# tools/dashboard/dsa_monitor/fstable_panel.py:H23_MASTER_DIR.
var/fstables/

# Output artifacts from bench/preflight/inject_*_allgpu.py runs.
# Quicklook PNGs + multi-GB owner cubes; stage to /dataz on h23
# when sharing, never the repo tree.
inject_cubes/

# Generated preview assets for docs/overview/ (slide PNGs / PPMs).
# Rebuilt locally from the LaTeX/Quarto sources on demand.
docs/overview/preview/

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoint snapshots.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
